dialect protocol stdio.semio.video.mutations
; encode_op is the UTF-8 bytes of print_op verbatim (protocol::OpBinary's own documented
; simplification, matching DocxMutation's own hand-rolled codec) — no separate binary layout. See
; the sibling 📝️text/📖️component.grammar.semio for the normative text grammar these bytes decode as.
body = UTF8-OCTET *
